Description: Collects arXiv papers related to cybersecurity, stores them locally,
    enriches them with topic classification and ML-based tagging, and provides an
    interactive Quarto dashboard for exploratory analysis. Includes MLflow integration
    for serving a PyTorch-based classifier via HTTP API.
